OL,3,GNEWSAMurderer given second life
OL,4,Asentence for stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for life for a
OL,7,Fsecond time after stabbing a member of
OL,8,Fstaff at supported accommodation in
OL,9,Fwhat prosecutors described as a
OL,10,F"payback" attack.
OL,12,FRichard Whyte, 55, stabbed Michael
OL,13,FSwift twice in the neck and chest with
OL,14,Fa small knife at accommodation in
OL,15,FCamberwell, South East London, where he
OL,16,Fhad lived for three years.
OL,18,FJudge Richard Marks said during
OL,19,Fsentencing at the Old Bailey: "You
OL,20,Fcould easily have ended up killing
OL,21,Fhim."
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
