OL,3,GNEWSAMurderer given second life
OL,4,Asentence for stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhyte was handed a discretionary life
OL,7,Fsentence with a minimum term of seven
OL,8,Fyears and one month. He had previously
OL,9,Fbeen given a life sentence for the
OL,10,Fsexually motivated murder of
OL,11,F29-year-old Caroline Williams in
OL,12,FRotherhithe more than 30 years ago.
